We further report that during the audit period:
- The Board of Directors and the members of the Company, at their respective meetings held on May 13, 2025, approved the appointment of M/s Kirtane & Pandit LLP (FRN: 105215W/W100057) as Joint Statutory Auditors of the Company, to hold office for a term of four years, until the conclusion of the 29th Annual General Meeting;
- the members of the Company, at their Extra-Ordinary General Meeting held on June 25, 2025, approved the appointment of Mr. Sumit Madan (DIN: 11149888) as the Managing Director & Chief Executive Officer of the Company for a term of five years effective October 1, 2025;
